#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:3
#: 9bdcd1c857a7426b95d09b4c337c7220
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:5
#: dc28d92e67c24645b7c03e0df380e168
msgid ""
"Parameters refer to the settings and configuration of the autopilot. The "
"following commands can be used to view and change the parameters:"
msgstr "参数是指飞控的设置与配置项。可使用以下命令查看和修改参数："

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:8
#: 858e6c21d4274c518d16d2ea0d4a336c
msgid ""
"Any specific parameter can be tab-completed. Otherwise, a list of possible "
"parameters is shown."
msgstr "任何特定参数均可通过Tab键补全。否则将显示可能的参数列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:11
#: bb333c738dea46e0a39b6c796dd2ce7d
msgid ""
"A visual parameter editor is available from the Console drop-down menu, "
"orcan be activated via ``module load paramedit``."
msgstr "可视化参数编辑器可从控制台下拉菜单访问，或通过 ``module load paramedit`` 激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:15
#: c1a6dd304ce34dc38031e02544ea5a21
msgid "param show"
msgstr "param show"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:17
#: 161390f93a2341ad95f01d4a6f28afa1
msgid "View all current parameters on the autopilot."
msgstr "查看飞控上所有当前参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:20
#: e0b50a27a4124d75b27457b7b64877e8
msgid "param set"
msgstr "param set"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:22
#: 410727560a354767bf5f5cb6bb97c7c6
msgid "Change a specified parameter to a particular value."
msgstr "将指定参数更改为特定值。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:29
#: 6c91a24cdfae4f63980e7b2105d6113c
msgid "param save"
msgstr "param save"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:31
#: 46f91d142ff541cca18ab0f3fd2d2642
msgid "Save all current parameters on the autopilot to file."
msgstr "将飞控上所有当前参数保存到文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:38
#: 7e6a7cb21b0c4a6399787a1904ff3861
msgid "param load"
msgstr "param load"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:40
#: 590587d28b71450f9978fca2a888c97f
msgid ""
"Load parameters from file to the autopilot. Only the parameters in the file "
"will be overwritten."
msgstr "从文件加载参数到飞控。仅文件中包含的参数会被覆盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:48
#: 7f430b4801e2495d8ec03b22539564d1
msgid "param diff"
msgstr "param diff"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:50
#: 05d55319e51a4fcb96e51f3edf84ff0c
msgid ""
"View the differences between the parameters in a file and what is currently "
"on the autopilot."
msgstr "查看文件中的参数与飞控当前参数之间的差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:58
#: e8fbe40705674d5799c661fe008151b2
msgid "Wildcards"
msgstr "通配符"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:60
#: a469bbd4c60f4e45b581c8f87c7c9a31
msgid ""
"Any of the above commands can be filtered by using wildcards, if only a "
"particular subset of parameters needs to be manipulated."
msgstr "以上所有命令均可使用通配符进行过滤，以便仅操作特定参数子集。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:69
#: b5a9024462e5477e9dec4b7ed7f70cfc
msgid "param download"
msgstr "param download"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:71
#: eba1c046c9a940de8ea90dbc896a6514
msgid ""
"Downloads the parameter definitions from the Internet and into a local "
"cache."
msgstr "从互联网下载参数定义并保存到本地缓存。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:79
#: b7a48165789548468b0812a322527cb3
msgid "param help"
msgstr "param help"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:81
#: ae46b4e3a6f241f4856f68c1bb30bc92
msgid "Shows further information (usage, notes) of the specified parameter."
msgstr "显示指定参数的详细信息（用途、说明）。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:88
#: e7730f7671f14d9cbeea93d0d0b37a38
msgid "param fetch"
msgstr "param fetch"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:90
#: 353f83617e4e422f9be24586645e825f
msgid ""
"Download all parameters, by default via MAVFTP. Otherwise it will fallback "
"to using ``PARAM_REQUEST_LIST``. Useful for refreshing the full list of "
"parameters."
msgstr "下载所有参数，默认通过MAVFTP方式；否则将回退至使用 ``PARAM_REQUEST_LIST``。适用于刷新完整参数列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:94
#: 98137e44aeb44955b8c8eed761da4a01
msgid ""
"If a single parameter is specified, only that parameter will downloaded."
msgstr "若指定单个参数，则仅下载该参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:102
#: cb9c5cadc9bf4c0eb7c525a76917187c
msgid "param ftp"
msgstr "param ftp"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:104
#: 9785370ac4c24b4faaa761c213c2d35d
msgid ""
"Download all parameters via MAVFTP. Useful for refreshing the full list of "
"parameters."
msgstr "通过MAVFTP下载所有参数。适用于刷新完整参数列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:112
#: f173e3d69ef54a03a18609334b07d18a
msgid "param revert"
msgstr "param revert"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/parameters.rst:114
#: 2898f849082441059891db4c935ed4f4
msgid "Revert the specified parameter to it's default value."
msgstr "将指定参数恢复为默认值。"
